{"3558420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Suck It Up!", "steam_appid": 3558420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HR CALLED... YOU'RE FIRED!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suck It Up! is a rogue-lite twin-stick shooter about sucking up your coworkers' insults and shouting them right back! With a fully destructible environment, carve your way through the office space and climb the corporate ladder, causing mayhem and fighting hordes of coworkers as you make your way to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/5b019eeca00e4d1b8ba95ad785bc5525.poster.avif?t=1781654412\" width=880 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/5b019eeca00e4d1b8ba95ad785bc5525.webm?t=1781654412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/5b019eeca00e4d1b8ba95ad785bc5525.mp4?t=1781654412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TELL THEM HOW YOU REALLY FEEL!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through an office filled with employees who will utilize a variety of elemental insults to tear you down. <strong>THUNDERING</strong> insults will pierce through walls, <strong>TOXIC</strong> ones will melt through steel like acid, and <strong>HEATED</strong> ones will explode, taking you and everyone in the room with you out of commission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/b9f8c02f31fa12927c6a48ec8ca33e82.poster.avif?t=1781654412\" width=896 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/b9f8c02f31fa12927c6a48ec8ca33e82.webm?t=1781654412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/b9f8c02f31fa12927c6a48ec8ca33e82.mp4?t=1781654412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DESTROY EVERYTHING!  </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>Fully Destructible Environment</strong>, nothing can stand in the way of you and a promotion, not even the building. Shoot, blast, and melt your way through walls, filing cabinets, and doors as you make your way from cubicle to corner office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/97b2428c20f6b3f18d7e4b944c38b746.poster.avif?t=1781654412\" width=896 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/97b2428c20f6b3f18d7e4b944c38b746.webm?t=1781654412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/97b2428c20f6b3f18d7e4b944c38b746.mp4?t=1781654412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE OFFICE SUPPLIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >File an array of found items and define your playstyle. Items in Suck It Up!, like a good set of pens, focus on quality over quantity. A single item can fundamentally change your playstyle for the rest of the workday.  Items are randomized  so that you can find  new ways to get back at the company that wronged you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/670aaa05860ffa2a1213001ab06ceb73.avif?t=1781654412\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras_big/670aaa05860ffa2a1213001ab06ceb73.webp?t=1781654412 width=1560 height=634 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BECOME YOUR OWN BOSS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat all the office floors to gain entrance to the Corporate Executive Overlord's office, where you must confront the very top of the corporate food chain! Beat different stages of combat to gain the upper hand and cement your place at the very TOP of the corporate ladder. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/e35f78f4cde843fc6ce003cfc4cb0745.poster.avif?t=1781654412\" width=896 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/e35f78f4cde843fc6ce003cfc4cb0745.webm?t=1781654412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/e35f78f4cde843fc6ce003cfc4cb0745.mp4?t=1781654412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HR CALLED... YOU'RE FIRED!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suck It Up! is a rogue-lite twin-stick shooter about sucking up your coworkers' insults and shouting them right back! With a fully destructible environment, carve your way through the office space and climb the corporate ladder, causing mayhem and fighting hordes of coworkers as you make your way to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/5b019eeca00e4d1b8ba95ad785bc5525.poster.avif?t=1781654412\" width=880 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/5b019eeca00e4d1b8ba95ad785bc5525.webm?t=1781654412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/5b019eeca00e4d1b8ba95ad785bc5525.mp4?t=1781654412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TELL THEM HOW YOU REALLY FEEL!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through an office filled with employees who will utilize a variety of elemental insults to tear you down. <strong>THUNDERING</strong> insults will pierce through walls, <strong>TOXIC</strong> ones will melt through steel like acid, and <strong>HEATED</strong> ones will explode, taking you and everyone in the room with you out of commission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/b9f8c02f31fa12927c6a48ec8ca33e82.poster.avif?t=1781654412\" width=896 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/b9f8c02f31fa12927c6a48ec8ca33e82.webm?t=1781654412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558420/extras/b9f8c02f31fa12927c6a48ec8ca33e82.mp4?t=1781654412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DESTROY EV